ects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/f76495f0-5dc8-4f94-b4f1-046947d52393" class="r-ha9o9s" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="bb759217-7d59-4f5d-828f-1c0ab5a332f9" class="r-tujp5n alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">Halal Certified</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f56da85d-c8d5-4f5c-96d8-4404211054c6" class="r-kew2dj"><div data-rid="4511ad44-5c4e-45f7-91c7-a63317ce6e00" class="r-1j9m11m"><div data-rid="ca9ddf3d-71e4-40cb-94a6-e4fe7cfe650b" class="r-kx2qbs"><div data-rid="c0aab403-7c32-40c5-ba09-f1161653bc4e" class="r-1dbk33l"><div data-rid="e2ddecc5-b0a5-4435-9657-5920dbeb6852" class="r-1mgy46n alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Frequently asked Questions</p></span></div><div data-rid="34bff494-af74-4df2-b5c7-6bd9f0c45e09" class="r-5vyeg4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Your questions answered here</p></span></div>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}<a data-rid="8054a8f8-e128-4022-b708-81de0d99a064" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-8moedi alchemy-rte" target="_blank" href="https://www.rawgeneration.com/pages/quiz" rel="noreferrer"><div data-rid="52afab06-d4f9-42d1-9aa2-077e314772a3" class="r-qlgdop alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span><strong>START LOSING WEIGHT</strong></span></p></span></div></a>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-end{%- endcomment -%}</div></div><div data-rid="d3dd0bc3-c11f-4bba-8a2a-aefe40f05a2f" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="meet-img-wrapper" tabindex="-1" id="meet-img-wrapper" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-2efyk3"><div data-rid="d0b572f4-13a4-4c8b-b9a1-d8abe352f862" class="r-9zkibo" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="1732caaa-dee4-40e1-90cb-c508e22fdea2" class="r-1265sq6" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="a626a0e8-3999-468d-9734-57d36df8ca59" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3mj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-c7pphj"><div data-rid="7e0e3de8-4feb-4cc4-80fe-dd326c648bb3" class="r-mm1t2z alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I eat on this cleanse?</p></span></div><div data-rid="11596c16-f430-426c-b502-dd0967b3a60b" class="r-1irjo6h"><div data-rid="8f7ebbad-edb7-490a-9a37-ff92ccbd4a3d" class="r-581y79" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-165ribh" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3mj2:"><div data-rid="7fa853af-f401-417c-bda7-c6c7a5d36e5a" class="r-1w1zfbk"><div data-rid="7b219825-88fc-4a9a-88c5-ad4d99ad4fb8" class="r-eml1oq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes! You do not have to commit to a strict juice fast for the Skinny Cleanse to be effective. While a straight juice diet will likely produce maximum results, you can certainly eat raw fruits, veggies, or other choices from the cleanse-approved foods list (found in your Cleanse Guide) without it hindering your weight loss efforts.</p><p><br></p><p>You might actually be MORE successful in achieving your goals if you eat. The satiation of chewing can help prevent ending your cleanse early due to hunger or intense cravings.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="c318cf19-e9fa-4435-b215-0713105c152a" class="r-e06okq" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="62e7e48f-d4d8-4ed1-ae1d-3f7f00c5cb3b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5mj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-twwtj5"><div data-rid="8fa20fbb-1fb0-406d-8d5b-afaf9acde5f1" class="r-1qcahyv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Can I drink coffee during my cleanse?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="504b0cd2-5b15-4d91-ae6c-d37c7b21abdc" class="r-6z8j9t"><div data-rid="10dcb29a-0bbc-43b3-8410-66ecef4abcd6" class="r-f8agvn" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1asnazy" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5mj2:"><div data-rid="2a76b609-cedd-40c0-ab6f-80c52e6ab2db" class="r-1p5d60u"><div data-rid="a9992131-2b3b-446d-bb29-d3a6e1159ce6" class="r-1ia7iaa alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes! We would never ask you to give up your coffee, however there are a few adjustments we recommend so it doesn’t interfere with your cleanse results. Drink your coffee black or with a low-fat plant milk, like oat milk. Replace sugar with honey.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a1c08a47-44f1-4248-9c83-2cd0d101324e" class="r-18wwysk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9009f1b8-d0b8-4b11-a33c-c6ca8ac93e75" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7mj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-cqf4u5"><div data-rid="b6faf818-37b7-48e4-aef8-7f742594e25b" class="r-7w0xp2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>How do I maintain my results after my cleanse?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="fb7e3c95-26fc-4979-8442-31f6ce8a75dd" class="r-1qeaoc8"><div data-rid="61e85452-62c1-4913-bb77-3ff69ff227e5" class="r-6fxtyo" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1emkax" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7mj2:"><div data-rid="08ca100a-a100-42fd-bf2b-09a5481d968d" class="r-1o8yuut"><div data-rid="c5b3c782-e2c9-4987-a694-903edb3a85b2" class="r-1lehvia alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The best way to maintain your results and avoid weight gain post-cleanse is with The Skinny Method™, a nutritionist-designed weekly weight loss system that helps you keep off the weight after a cleanse and then continue to lose an additional 2-3 pounds per week.*</p><p><br></p><p>To learn more about The Skinny Method™, click here.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="cf1624ba-aac8-4ba3-959f-7b931908a630" class="r-1klug61" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c1a9c3c6-242a-4833-8201-2b07fe380246" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9mj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1xusr70"><div data-rid="b3890b90-de59-463c-a1e9-686e5ab4892f" class="r-gtxxon alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Are these weight loss juices low-calorie and low sugar?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="7e2d6304-9f11-4d6a-b5af-7efa63d15e6c" class="r-1az2za"><div data-rid="d405bb70-eeaf-4a97-88ea-e24d94d806c4" class="r-1kq2h24" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-5wtf1m" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R9mj2:"><div data-rid="7ac624a8-2133-4d41-98a3-8983f3d9894b" class="r-1s8f8n3"><div data-rid="9fc7cd5d-4286-450f-8b7c-456d127e16fc" class="r-u7l2w0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our in-house nutritionist believes that low-calorie fad diets do not lead to successful weight loss or weight management long-term. Any restrictive diets almost always lead to failure.</p><p><br></p><p>True health and real weight loss are not about counting calories, tracking fat grams, or limiting sugar intake. It’s about choosing options with the right nutrient-dense ingredients.</p><p><br></p><p>That being said, the weight loss juices in this cleanse were not designed to be low in calories, carbs, or natural fruit sugars. They provide your body with what it needs to thrive in the healthiest form possible…and the result is sustainable weight loss.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1539891c-9898-4b53-968e-cec8ce67437e" class="r-x589e9" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="75c04dde-368e-4bfa-99cb-8fe29c599b65" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbmj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-18pdgul"><div data-rid="3743c3a8-d61f-4c69-9073-76c770c3636d" class="r-1xwoe58 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Why are the juices frozen?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="aa5fff84-fce5-47bb-88b5-26012fdbd006" class="r-yuege6"><div data-rid="a2fedbcd-f211-48b1-a0b2-6379d2af1599" class="r-mqigoh" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-fs6znz" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rbmj2:"><div data-rid="544962e3-8e0b-4f31-b3bf-6e55d5619ea1" class="r-1t7tjax"><div data-rid="96091c9e-9f5b-4245-b44d-71b0776afe08" class="r-7qy9w9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We immediately flash-freeze all cold-pressed juices and smoothies. This is the only way to lock in the fresh flavor, raw nutrients, and enzymes, while still being able to deliver them to your door.</p><p><br></p><p>Shipping juices frozen makes it super convenient for you. There’s no hefty prep time or messy clean-up. No juicer or blender is necessary for you to enjoy these juice recipes. All you have to do is thaw, sip, and experience the health benefits.</p><br><p>Plus, if life gets in the way and you have to pause your cleanse, nothing goes to waste. The remaining bottles can stay in the freezer until you can start again.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}<a data-rid="178843e2-20eb-4b8a-86f6-d5ebbe07d4b8" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-16i7210 alchemy-rte" target="_blank" href="https://www.rawgeneration.com/pages/quiz" rel="noreferrer"><div data-rid="5ba1a679-4ec9-4353-8df0-81783ae9d463" class="r-at6yh6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span><strong>START LOSING WEIGHT</strong></span></p></span></div></a>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-end{%- endcomment -%}</div></div><div data-rid="432be199-6b66-4957-989b-a2c6ee91e7f0" class="r-shhl4i"><div data-rid="b85298d3-9466-4c6b-be0e-2bbf6dfa570d" class="r-79v8b0"><div data-rid="28aa62d9-0584-4198-88e2-d7acb6a87d52" class="r-nodjvq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>As seen in</p></span></div><div data-rid="ae21a2bd-2cec-47f6-a427-cb6a0352d7d8" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="scroller" tabindex="-1" id="scroller" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1voh8y"><div data-replo-marquee-root="true" data-rid="c4050c27-0362-4c5e-bd23-a33481809ded" class="r-138nc30"><div class="r-191ip1u" data-replo-marquee-track="true"><div data-rid="7e033baf-09a9-421d-8eae-099e77c19d87" class="r-w28m8b"><picture data-rid="6